  "body": "Imagine waking up, grabbing a coffee and strolling along Orewa Beach, all before the rest of your day begins.\r\n\r\nNo lawns to mow. No weekends lost to maintenance. Just the freedom to enjoy everything that makes coastal living so special.\r\n\r\nAND THE BEST PART? YOU DON'T HAVE TO WAIT FOR YOUR NEXT HOLIDAY TO ENJOY IT.\r\n\r\nJust moments from the beach, cafés and restaurants, this near-new, approximately 75sqm apartment offers a lifestyle many dream about, with the flexibility to make it your own.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover light-filled open-plan living flowing onto a balcony with sea views. Your own little spot to unwind, entertain or simply watch the world go by.\r\n\r\nEVERYTHING YOU NEED, NOTHING YOU DON'T.\r\n• Two bedrooms and a walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Balcony with sea views\r\n• Double glazing and heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n• Excellent storage, secure parking and storage locker\r\n• Modern, low-maintenance living in the heart of Orewa\r\n\r\nMake it your everyday home, your weekend coastal retreat, or explore the opportunity to generate rental income when you're not using it.\r\n\r\nWHY KEEP DREAMING ABOUT THE COASTAL LIFESTYLE WHEN YOU COULD BE LIVING IT?\r\n\r\nWhether you're ready to simplify your life, escape to the coast or secure a property for the future, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nDON'T LEAVE THIS ONE ON YOUR WISH LIST.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
